OL,3,GNEWSAWorks to repair historic pier 'not
OL,4,Agone to plan'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorks to restore a historic pier which
OL,7,Fwas badly damaged by strong waves and
OL,8,Fstormy weather has "not gone according
OL,9,Fto plan", a city council has said.
OL,11,FThe eastern section of West Hoe Pier in
OL,12,FPlymouth collapsed during Storm Bram in
OL,13,FDecember 2025, while it undergoing
OL,14,Fstrengthening work to infill the
OL,15,Finterior after the stones within it had
OL,16,Fbeen washed out to sea over many years.
OL,18,FPlymouth City Council said the project
OL,19,Fto restore the Grade II listed pier was
OL,20,Fgetting "back on track" following the
OL,21,Fincident and winter "is very much on
OL,22,Four mind".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
